Package: peditools2
Title: Pediatric and Neonatal Growth Chart Calculations and Parameters
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joseph", "Chou", email = "joe.nicu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Z-scores, probabilities and measurements for pediatric, neonatal
    and fetal growth charts and standards (CDC, WHO, INTERGROWTH-21st and
    others) from their published parameters, by the LMS method, the WHO
    restricted LMS method, the CDC extended BMI method and the INTERGROWTH-21st
    models. The parameter tables and their references are those of PediTools
    <https://peditools.org/>, where each chart's sources and methods are
    described.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jhchou/peditools2, https://peditools.org/
BugReports: https://github.com/jhchou/peditools2/issues
